# build-deb.sh has no --help flag.
# This file documents its stable observable interface.
#
# USAGE (from source):
#   build-deb.sh <distro> [<package-version>]
#
# DISTRO values:
#   noble      — builds for Ubuntu 24.04 (suffix: ubuntu24.04)
#   resolute   — builds for Ubuntu 26.04 (suffix: ubuntu26.04)
#
# ERROR on unrecognised distro (stderr + exit 1):
#   "Unsupported distribution <distro>"
#
# NOTE: no dry-run mode.  Script requires dpkg toolchain to do real work.
# The error message on bad arg is the only stable offline-testable output.
#
# VERIFIED with: bash build-deb.sh badarg 2>&1 | grep "Unsupported distribution"
# Output: Unsupported distribution badarg

Unsupported distribution
